6", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162788_1159088237569028_8479258378613293056_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5OHww8wlAm4Q7kNvwFYIhwl&_nc_oc=AdoQ5jG-pXxnc3Y9SA9J2S1cHKlF8w2_DvDbwuGcXNyS0fP2BvSze5wzybFC8ggz5P4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQCB1_7zcdRaG48SKpQXZlfrxiYcg-IrnH2mKK1JWfDHQ&oe=6AFDB426"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "238239477573780", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162711_217098705454116_3705581251936124928_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M3_ZRlZh3R4Q7kNvwGxaSNR&_nc_oc=Adq0XEz3au2ks9E39cJa1S8Z57p75uQIjsqTEZNAFruu1TMqkbyJ3-gTp_XRPAjukxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQiqVrt7WdvVltgKImUUb0ruJys20CuWgQ-ViwqzAYx5w&oe=6AFDC552"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "195263755099652", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162700_1297907176995014_366968912077651968_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1M93wo5eNtwQ7kNvwEvcjNI&_nc_oc=Adpk8olIxGOjDvLuQNjnSztR_cY2lrgiLFrCHrHgtb6dUNkztm6Cik93Q_0u9fasThI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSsCQkml4XX1oKdbcQTLbIRmcWrIhAUWd4NYMPU4UwDiQ&oe=6AFDC98C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer thumbnail.png", "id": "1373656182681163", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162707_1373656186014496_5169794628878073856_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DyddcYO2K_QQ7kNvwFf139v&_nc_oc=AdqRiyigpQ3Lvlh_ErLgfnzElD3VHC4DAjmJgsAwLu7SutX90Mz_KejxWdU_O4WRSyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS4_tGBZnhD5v0EQWjtZ9wf2G5yLrEaUI65RW_PyzzDpg&oe=6AFDC7AC"}, "display_name": "Raising A Rukus", "keywords": ["Animated", "Kids", "Dog", "Dinosaur", "Film"], "long_description": "Twins Amy and Jonas just found a dog- or did he find them? Either way, Rukus has a magical secret \u2013 he\u2019s about to take them to a whole new world. \n\nEqual parts thrilling, breathtaking, and inspiring, Raising a Rukus is an animated adventure like no other. With cutting edge \u201cbranching narratives,\u201d choose which character\u2019s journey you want to follow by a simple gaze with your eyes. \n\nJump right into magical, rollercoaster journey through a prehistoric world! Come along for the ride with Jonas and Amy as the river propels you, dinosaurs chase you, and Rukus delights you!\n\nRaising a Rukus is the first episode of the groundbreaking new franchise from the Academy Award Winning Production Designer of Avatar and the Director of Maleficent.", "short_description": "Ride along with twins Amy and Jonas as they chase their mischievous pet dog, Rukus, through an amazing adventure into a prehistoric world. \n\nWith cutting edge \u201cbranching narratives,\u201d choose which character to follow and discover a different path with a simple gaze of your eyes!\n\nA new animated experience from Oscar-winner Robert Stromberg and The Virtual Reality Company."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.thevrcompany.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thevrcompany.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "The Virtual Reality Company", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.thevrcompany.com/raising-a-rukus", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "ACTION", "EDUCATIONAL", "MOVIE", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": 